Package: fastcit
Title: Fast Conditional Independence Tests
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Ankur", "Ankan", email = "ankurankan@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("GIP House", role = "aut"),
    person("pgmpy", role = "cph")
    )
Description: R bindings for a collection of conditional independence tests
    implemented in Rust. Supports discrete, continuous, and mixed data via
    chi-squared, log-likelihood, Cressie-Read, Freeman-Tukey, Pearson
    correlation, modified log-likelihood, and Pearson equivalence tests.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://pgmpy.org/FastCIT/, https://github.com/pgmpy/FastCIT
BugReports: https://github.com/pgmpy/FastCIT/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
